module stratacorpus

; The performance corpus.
;
; This layer adds no primitive and widens nothing. The workloads, the
; accounting and the policy decision are Strata's own --
; `strata/system/corpus.strata` -- and the only thing Meta contributes is
; the source list the checks link.

judgment StrataCorpusSystem [prelude native octets artifact collections reach corpus] =
  list [prelude native octets artifact collections reach corpus]
